                    chart_ds_fairness:      `Perceived Fairness`,
                    chart_ds_adoption:      `Change Adoption`,
                    chart_ds_attrition:     `Regretted Attrition % (lower better)`,
                    chart_axis_kpi:         `KPIs 0–100`,
                    chart_axis_attrition:   `Attrition %`,
                    chart_axis_round:       `Round`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (the works-council rep & the integration board)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Two clocks are running: my people are deciding every week whether to update their CV, and the board reviews you on 15 May. Remember the lesson of an emotional-events view of change — behaviour follows the emotions events provoke, not the merger’s objective merits. The loudest grievance is rarely the highest-leverage one, the workforce is not one number, and resistance is data to read, not noise to mute. Show me you can read the signals, match the justice to the real grievance, free meaning without dropping critical work, and tell the board in cash why fairness beats redundancies.`,

                    attrition_label:        `Regretted Attrition`,
