                    r2_total_cap:           `/ £1,200K`,
                    r2_target_label:        `For the 210 senior engineers specifically, what will they feel first?`,
                    alloc_distributive:     `Distributive — harmonise pay bands upward (the loudest grievance, the most expensive fix) — £K`,
